          "summary": "Tech Times reports that macOS Tahoe 26.7 RC 2 removed the unannounced-product references, media assets, and staging code found in RC 1, including the camera-equipped AirPods material. Apple has not documented the cleanup, and Version Record has not independently compared the binaries, so this occurrence remains reported rather than confirmed.",
          "documentedStatus": "undocumented",
